"module": "blackout", "source_id": "AFTD2022-EXP-2332d9548f2abd01", "guideline_quote": "If the cause of the blackout is determined to be a medical condition not covered in the standards, then first principles regarding fitness to drive should be applied (refer to Part A section 2. Assessing fitness to drive – general guidance).", "fact_fields": ["blackout.diagnosis"], "licence_pathway": "conditional", "finding": "established_restriction", "conclusion": "The patient's blackout is due to hypoglycaemia, which is a medical condition not covered in the standards."}, {
